{"id":"fae6bcb694dc1aa7","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-thm-woodin-cardinal.md","title":"Woodin Cardinal Characterization","display":"thm-woodin-cardinal — Woodin Cardinal Characterization","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-woodin-cardinal","aliases":["58-thm-woodin-cardinal","Woodin Cardinal Theorem","Woodin Cardinal Properties"],"display":"thm-woodin-cardinal — Woodin Cardinal Characterization","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-woodin.md]]","[[../batch07/58-df-woodin-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch12/58-df-zfc-lc-woodin-cardinal-witness.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-woodin-cardinal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-woodin-cardinal</span><span>Woodin Cardinal Theorem</span><span>Woodin Cardinal Properties</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-woodin-cardinal — Woodin Cardinal Characterization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"da3159c0c219916e\" href=\"?note=da3159c0c219916e\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-woodin.md\">../batch08/58-df-woodin.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"164488c69fed4a7f\" href=\"?note=164488c69fed4a7f\" title=\"../batch07/58-df-woodin-cardinal.md\">../batch07/58-df-woodin-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"f9019f8b9c0a2aa1\" href=\"?note=f9019f8b9c0a2aa1\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-zfc-lc-woodin-cardinal-witness.md\">../batch12/58-df-zfc-lc-woodin-cardinal-witness.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\">\\(\\delta\\)</span> (cardinal)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Woodin}(\\delta)\">\\(\\mathrm{Woodin}(\\delta)\\)</span> (Woodin-cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"da3159c0c219916e\" href=\"?note=da3159c0c219916e\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-woodin.md\">../batch08/58-df-woodin.md</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\delta)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\delta)\\)</span> (cardinal predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq V_\\delta\">\\(A\\subseteq V_\\delta\\)</span> (set parameter)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLcWoodinCardinalWitness}_S(\\delta,A,\\kappa)\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLcWoodinCardinalWitness}_S(\\delta,A,\\kappa)\\)</span> (class-quantifying metalinguistic strongness witness)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>本文件使用类量词元语言；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLcWoodinCardinalWitness}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLcWoodinCardinalWitness}_S\\)</span> 是依赖文件中已展开的元语言兼容名，下标 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 不把类嵌入变为集合。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{meta}\">\\(\\mathrm{meta}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}woodin\\text{-}cardinal}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\mathrm{Woodin}(\\delta)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\delta)\\land\n\\forall A\\subseteq V_\\delta\\;\\exists\\kappa\\in\\delta\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcLcWoodinCardinalWitness}_S(\\delta,A,\\kappa)\n\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}woodin\\text{-}cardinal}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{meta}}\n\\mathrm{Woodin}(\\delta)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\delta)\\land\n\\forall A\\subseteq V_\\delta\\;\\exists\\kappa\\in\\delta\\;\n\\mathrm{ZfcLcWoodinCardinalWitness}_S(\\delta,A,\\kappa)\n\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>For every <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq V_\\delta\">\\(A\\subseteq V_\\delta\\)</span> there is a <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa&lt;\\delta\">\\(\\kappa&lt;\\delta\\)</span> that is\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>-strong up to every <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda&lt;\\delta\">\\(\\lambda&lt;\\delta\\)</span>, with agreement\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j(A)\\cap V_\\lambda=A\\cap V_\\lambda\">\\(j(A)\\cap V_\\lambda=A\\cap V_\\lambda\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>A Woodin cardinal is a limit of cardinals that are strong below <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta\">\\(\\delta\\)</span> in this parameter-sensitive sense; it need not itself be a strong cardinal.</li>\n<li>Infinitely many Woodin cardinals with a measurable cardinal above them give the standard large-cardinal upper bound for projective determinacy.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-woodin.md","status":"resolved","id":"da3159c0c219916e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-woodin.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch07/58-df-woodin-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"164488c69fed4a7f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depen